#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.skladnik.metainfo.xml:13
msgid "Skladnik"
msgstr "Skladnik"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.skladnik.metainfo.xml:14
msgid "Sokoban Game"
msgstr "Sokoban"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.skladnik.metainfo.xml:16
msgid "Skladnik is an implementation of the Japanese warehouse keeper game “sokoban”."
msgstr "Skladnik je izvedba japanske igre za skladištara „sokoban”."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.skladnik.metainfo.xml:19
msgid "The idea is that you are a warehouse keeper trying to push crates to their proper locations in a warehouse. The problem is that you cannot pull the crates or step over them. If you are not careful, some of the crates can get stuck in wrong places and/or block your way."
msgstr "Igrate skladištara koji pokušava gurnuti sanduke na odgovarajuća mjesta u skladištu. Sanduke ne možete vući ni preskakati. Ako ne budete oprezni, neki se sanduci mogu zaglaviti na pogrešnim mjestima i/ili vam zapriječiti put."
